{"product_id":"art-directors-annual-85","title":"Art Directors Annual 85","description":"\u003cp\u003eA showcase of the most prestigious competition in the fieldFounded in 1920 and based in Manhattan, New York, the Art Directors Club has become the premier international organization for creative professionals. The Art Directors Club of New York Awards is the toughest competition in the field, honoring the very best in visual innovation and excellence in graphic design, interactive design, interactive media, photography and illustration.The Art Directors Annual 85 is the latest release in this long-established series, showcasing, in full color, the winners of the competition in all fields of international creative arts, presenting the work of students alongside that of the established professionals.The Art Directors Annual has established itself as the premier international visual reference annual, and the latest in the series does not fail to deliver in providing an essential source of information and inspiration for all creative professionals and students alike.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 210 x 292\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: The Art Directors Club\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9782940361793\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 446\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45354070835353,"sku":"1RA9782940361793","price":40.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6811f37ea4f61_Art_Directors_Annual_85_The_Art_Directors_Club.jpg?v=1746027629","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/art-directors-annual-85","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}